er to shoot for the high score.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/link-s-crossbow-training", "collections": [{"id": 106, "name": "The Legend of Zelda"}]}